  m_text: "This is an Emergency Broadcast\r\nDo not panic.\r\nPlease remain calm.
    \r\nA nuclear stike is estimated to hit your area in\r\n65 minutes\r\nDo not
    panic.\r\nEvacuate the area immediately outside the blast radius and fallout
